Since MiniOS is cross-built with the host compiler with just different
header/library paths, lib/configure can not really detect it by itself. pciutils
thus needs to be built with an explicit libpci.config.mak reading:

PCI_OS_MINIOS=1
PCI_HAVE_STDINT_H=1
PCI_PATH_IDS_DIR=.
PCI_IDS=pci.ids

and libpci.config.h reading:

#define PCI_OS_MINIOS in
#define PCI_HAVE_STDINT_H
#define PCI_PATH_IDS_DIR "."
#define PCI_IDS "pci.ids"
